{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Audio-Language Models \u2014 Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: query Qwen2.5-Omni"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "from transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoProcessor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "processor = AutoProcessor.from_pretrained(\"Qwen/Qwen2.5-Omni-7B\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(\"Qwen/Qwen2.5-Omni-7B\", torch_dtype=\"auto\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "audio, sr = load_wav(\"clip.wav\", sr=16000)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "messages = [{"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"role\": \"user\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"content\": ["
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        {\"type\": \"audio\", \"audio\": audio},"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"What sounds do you hear, and what's happening?\"},"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    ],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "inputs = processor.apply_chat_template(messages, tokenize=True, return_tensors=\"pt\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "output = model.generate(**inputs, max_new_tokens=200)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(processor.decode(output[0], skip_special_tokens=True))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: the projector pattern"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import torch.nn as nn"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class AudioProjector(nn.Module):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def __init__(self, audio_dim=1280, llm_dim=4096):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        super().__init__()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.down = nn.Linear(audio_dim, llm_dim)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.act = nn.GELU()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.up = nn.Linear(llm_dim, llm_dim)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def forward(self, audio_features):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return self.up(self.act(self.down(audio_features)))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "That's it. The projector is usually 1-3 linear layers. Training it on ASR pairs (audio \u2192 transcript) is the Stage-1 pretext task."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: benchmarking MMAU / LongAudioBench"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "from datasets import load_dataset"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "mmau = load_dataset(\"MMAU/MMAU-Pro\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "correct = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "for item in mmau[\"test\"]:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    answer = call_model(item[\"audio\"], item[\"question\"], item[\"choices\"])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if answer == item[\"correct_choice\"]:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        correct += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(f\"Accuracy: {correct / len(mmau['test']):.3f}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Report per-category (speech / sound / music / multi-audio) separately. Aggregate numbers hide where the model fails."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. **Easy.** Run `code/main.py` to see a toy projector pattern + fake LALM routing of (audio-embedding, text-tokens) \u2192 output tokens.\n2. **Medium.** Score Qwen2.5-Omni-7B on 100 MMAU-Pro speech items. Compare to the paper's reported number.\n3. **Hard.** Build a minimal audio-captioning baseline: BEATs encoder + 2-layer projector + frozen Llama-3.2-1B. Fine-tune only the projector on AudioCaps. Compare to SALMONN on Clotho-AQA."
      ]
    }
